{"unit_id":"tokenaissance__dsh-excalidraw#feature-1","repo":"tokenaissance/dsh-excalidraw","commit":"0794a1d10a8c67c6324c0c749331d1793b90e5be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-excalidraw 的功能「远程刷新场景」：通过 excalidraw_refresh 从 Excalidraw+ MCP 拉取场景并保存到当前工作区，随后请求打开场景视图。可指定 sceneId、名称或文件 slug。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:566-608","lib/mcp.js:1-16"]}
{"unit_id":"tokenaissance__dsh-excalidraw#feature-2","repo":"tokenaissance/dsh-excalidraw","commit":"0794a1d10a8c67c6324c0c749331d1793b90e5be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-excalidraw 的功能「导入本地场景」：通过 excalidraw_import 读取工作区内的 .excalidraw 或 .json 文件，也可提交包含 elements 数组的场景对象；保存后在 DSH 视图中展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:636-682"]}
{"unit_id":"tokenaissance__dsh-excalidraw#feature-3","repo":"tokenaissance/dsh-excalidraw","commit":"0794a1d10a8c67c6324c0c749331d1793b90e5be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-excalidraw 的功能「打开已存场景」：使用 excalidraw_open 按 slug 聚焦已保存的场景视图；省略 slug 时展示最近保存的场景，不会重新请求 Excalidraw+。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:610-634"]}
{"unit_id":"tokenaissance__dsh-excalidraw#feature-4","repo":"tokenaissance/dsh-excalidraw","commit":"0794a1d10a8c67c6324c0c749331d1793b90e5be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-excalidraw 的功能「导出 SVG」：使用 excalidraw_export 将已保存场景渲染为 SVG 并写入场景目录；可选指定 slug，未指定时导出最新场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:685-704","src/renderer.mjs:938-970"]}
{"unit_id":"tokenaissance__dsh-excalidraw#feature-5","repo":"tokenaissance/dsh-excalidraw","commit":"0794a1d10a8c67c6324c0c749331d1793b90e5be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-excalidraw 的功能「浏览场景图」：DSH 客户端把 Excalidraw 元素渲染成 SVG，支持矩形、椭圆、菱形、线条、箭头、文本、框架和图像等元素。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/renderer.mjs:17-35","src/renderer.mjs:938-970"]}
